menu "B-T HOME mains measurement"
config BTH_MAINS_MILLIVOLTS_PER_COUNT
    int "Calibrated mains millivolts per ADC RMS count (0 = uncalibrated)"
    range 0 100000
    default 0
    help
        Set to round(1000 * reference mains Vrms / reported ADC RMS).
        Includes the module gain and external voltage divider. Recalibrate
        after changing the potentiometer, divider or ADC.
endmenu
